      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "How to use\n\n1. Pick your checkpoint in Load Checkpoint.\n2. While exploring prompts, select the hires-pass nodes (ImageScaleBy through Save Image) and press Ctrl+B to bypass them. You then only get the fast base preview.\n3. When you like an image, set the base KSampler seed to fixed, un-bypass the hires nodes (Ctrl+B again) and run once more.\n\nHires pass: denoise 0.35 to 0.45 adds detail. Higher values start changing the picture.\nIf the hires pass runs out of memory, lower scale_by to 1.3 or start ComfyUI with --lowvram.\n\nAnime Post FX: set any effect to 0 to turn it off."
      ]
    }
